          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As they went away, Jesus began to speak to the crowds concerning John: “What did you go out into the wilderness to behold? A reed shaken by the wind? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why then did you go out? To see a man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "What then did you go out to see? A man . . .",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " clothed in soft raiment? Behold, those who wear soft raiment are in kings' houses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
